## CQ-TSL-02
@group client
@commands Open a chest (slot shows), close; `/gamemode spectator`; open the inventory or a chest
@pass no trash slot drawn in spectator; back to survival, chest shows the slot again
@fails `creativecompat$spectatorClears` redirect
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> setblock 0 101 0 minecraft:chest
# r1123cx (2026-11-23): look adds 0.5 to x and z (block coordinates), so the old "0.5 ... -1.5" stood on the chest edge and missed it
do {"look": {"from": "0 102.6 -2", "at": "0 101 0"}}
do {"use": true}
do {"wait": "screen:ContainerScreen"}
shot chest_survival
do {"screen": "close"}
> gamemode spectator
do {"screen": "inventory"}
shot inventory_spectator
do {"screen": "close"}
> gamemode creative
do {"use": true}
do {"wait": "screen:ContainerScreen"}
shot chest_back
do {"screen": "close"}
look first and last shots show the trash slot; the spectator shot shows none
